  <HediffDef ParentName="EH_ElementalHeartHediffBase">
    <defName>EH_ThunderIncarnate</defName>
    <label>Thunder Incarnate</label>
    <description>A sovereign of black/yellow lightning, equal to Celestial in core melee damage, incoming damage reduction, recovery and resolve. Seven forms: Divine Severance, Thunderstep Strike, Blackbolt Waltz, Skybreaker Judgment, Heaven-Rending Dragon, Heavenfall Verdict and Sovereign Thunderfall. Thunderfall brings down a colossal white-hot pillar threaded with yellow lightning and a ten-cell shockwave, striking each eligible hostile once. Varied forms build Storm Dominion; charged Judgment, Verdict and Thunderfall gain 20% damage and two seconds of extra protection.

Health capacities on a healthy human: Moving 650%, Consciousness 200%, Manipulation 300%, Sight/Hearing 250%. Core incoming damage factor 0.04, +75 mood, rapid recovery and 90% electrical resistance. Full-body black princely regalia, a larger white-bladed Heavenbreaker katana, lightning motion trails and a drafted storm crown. Bestow grants ordinary Lightning.

Damage: x3.2 Melee damage, matching Celestial. Shared 20% damage tuning gives an otherwise identical eligible physical packet x2.56 before armor, other modifiers and technique coefficients. No second lineage multiplier. Electrical injury has a 45% chance to shock for 1.5 seconds, followed by three seconds of discharge recovery. Non-lethal uses suppression without new wounds. Visual frames never add pawn impacts. Lethal techniques produce bounded scenery blasts, ash and native fires; Non-lethal or mod settings disable scenery damage and ignition. Right-click the shared utility button to cycle Step: Auto, Step: Manual (automatic stepping off), and Thunder Travel (automatic stepping off). Step left-click also toggles Auto/Manual; Shift + left-click targets a map-wide blink. Travel left-click chooses a world tile and an exact landing cell; Shift + left-click uses quick automatic landing. The picker pauses safely and marks valid or blocked cells. A drafted, transformed Incarnate projects an animated lightning back aura; ordinary katana slashes scatter visual lightning.</description>
    <comps>
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_LightningRecovery">
        <sealAfterTicks>60</sealAfterTicks>
        <healPerSecond>4</healPerSecond>
      </li>
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_LightningPassives">
        <strikeElectrical>0.5</strikeElectrical>
        <chainChance>0.25</chainChance>
        <chainRadius>4</chainRadius>
        <chainDamageFactor>0.4</chainDamageFactor>
        <chainTargets>3</chainTargets>
        <chainInterval>6</chainInterval>
        <maxCharge>3</maxCharge>
        <chargeDuration>600</chargeDuration>
        <killCooldownReduction>90</killCooldownReduction>
        <dancePerCharge>0.6</dancePerCharge>
        <heavenPerCharge>0.5</heavenPerCharge>
        <counterChance>0.5</counterChance>
        <counterCooldown>120</counterCooldown>
        <resistanceFactor>0.1</resistanceFactor>
        <electricalDamageDefs>
          <li>EH_Lightning</li>
          <li>EMP</li>
          <li>EH_ThunderstormDamage</li>
        </electricalDamageDefs>
      </li>
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_LightningAbilities">
        <severRange>10</severRange>
        <flashRange>15</flashRange>
        <danceRadius>4</danceRadius>
        <heavenRange>12</heavenRange>
        <severCooldown>300</severCooldown>
        <flashCooldown>360</flashCooldown>
        <danceCooldown>540</danceCooldown>
        <heavenCooldown>1350</heavenCooldown>
        <telegraphTicks>12</telegraphTicks>
        <staggerTicks>60</staggerTicks>
        <fistFloor>10</fistFloor>
        <explosionRadius>3</explosionRadius>
        <severPhysical>1.5</severPhysical>
        <severElectrical>0.8</severElectrical>
        <flashPhysical>2</flashPhysical>
        <flashElectrical>1</flashElectrical>
        <dancePhysical>1.5</dancePhysical>
        <danceElectrical>1</danceElectrical>
        <heavenPhysical>6</heavenPhysical>
        <heavenElectrical>4</heavenElectrical>
        <explosionElectrical>1.5</explosionElectrical>
      </li>
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_IncarnateMastery" />
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_ThunderIncarnate" />
    </comps>
    <stages>
